<p>Wa Hussaina Hussaina Hussain(a.s)<br />
Wa Hussaina Hussaina Hussain(a.s)</p>

<p>1. Zehra(s.a) ka dulaara pyaasa gaya maara<br />
mohtaaje kafan hai Ahmad(saws) ka nawaasa<br />
Thaame jigar kehti thi maa'n Hussain(a.s)<br />
Wa Hussaina Hussaina Hussain(a.s)</p>

<p>2. Wo tashna dahaani darya ki rawaani<br />
Darya ke labo'n par hai teri kahaani<br />
Pyaso'n ka gham apna armaa'n Hussain(a.s)<br />
Wa Hussaina Hussaina Hussain(a.s)</p>

<p>3. Matam jo na hoga hum kaise jiyenge<br />
gar mout bhi aaye Matam ye karenge<br />
Seeno'n me hai jab tak ye jaa'n Hussain(a.s)<br />
Wa Hussaina Hussaina Hussain(a.s)</p>

<p>4. Shiyou'n ko mili hai Zehra(s.a) ki duayei'n<br />
Matam me jawaano sab haath uthaaye<br />
Dil se bolei'n saare jawaa'n Hussain(a.s)<br />
Wa Hussaina Hussaina Hussain(a.s)</p>

<p>5. Jab shimr ka khanjar chalta tha gale par<br />
Deti thi duhaayi you'n Zainab e Muztar<br />
Kaise dekhu'n Aye Bhaijaa'n Hussain(a.s)<br />
Wa Hussaina Hussaina Hussain(a.s)</p>

<p>
<center><h4>Kalaam : Ustad e Mohtram Janab Dawar Ali Dawar Sahab</h4></center></p>
